WEBVTT

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:32.265
'Estonya, Latvya, Litwanya,

00:12:32.265 --> 00:12:35.151
Mali, Madaġašqer,

00:12:35.151 --> 00:12:38.933
Polonya, el-Filipin,

00:12:38.933 --> 00:12:44.016
Ṣerbya, Slovenya, w nzid,

00:12:44.016 --> 00:12:48.606
w ḍerwek f Tunes w Maṣer.

00:12:48.606 --> 00:12:52.656
W hada ma ṣraš ġir hak.

00:12:52.656 --> 00:12:55.807
El-kutriya b sebba’t waḥed el-ktab

00:12:55.807 --> 00:13:00.272
Ketbu waḥed el-šibani ɛumru 80 ɛam, men Boston w semmuh Gene Sharp.